      "line": 165,
      "source_sha256": "d3bde3ae75f455e65caddc81ea5f8032bfcd36202636ccbf0c3a635719902faf",
      "line_text": "## Theorem 3 -- the sharp wall's band is gapped, and a mass through zero carries zero modes",
      "line_sha256": "6ee8c442c37f5d7352737c52e9b7f0f5a385697b08b2314b2cc511727dfbce55"
    },
    {
      "finding": "F3",
      "path": "docs/RECORD_WALLS_IN_THE_STAGGERED_MASS_CARRY_LOCALIZED_2P1D_DIRAC_MATTER_VECTOR_LIKE_BOUNDED_THEOREM_NOTE_2026-09-03.md",
      "line": 220,
      "source_sha256": "d3bde3ae75f455e65caddc81ea5f8032bfcd36202636ccbf0c3a635719902faf",
      "line_text": "   profile passing through zero carries exact zero modes. Whether the law can supply a graded mass is an interface, named below and not decided here.",
      "line_sha256": "cc9d79db5998597375b86e70f5fb8480c5656450996aa8001f751a4f5e76b08f"
    },
    {
      "finding": "F3",
      "path": "docs/RECORD_WALLS_IN_THE_STAGGERED_MASS_CARRY_LOCALIZED_2P1D_DIRAC_MATTER_VECTOR_LIKE_BOUNDED_THEOREM_NOTE_2026-09-03.md",
      "line": 215,
      "source_sha256": "d3bde3ae75f455e65caddc81ea5f8032bfcd36202636ccbf0c3a635719902faf",
      "line_text": "1. **Record walls carry localized 2+1D Dirac matter.** Four modes per wall per node -- two two-component 2+1D Dirac fermions, one per taste -- with the cone at `(pi, pi)` of",
      "line_sha256": "f9651dd712a6c880afcb15dc7f224340d7e4e7ab772a211781bdb1f31b13335d"
    },
    {
