      "line_text": "check(\"C2 [numerical] a supplied mass PASSING THROUGH ZERO restores zero modes: at w = 4 the gap \"",
      "line_sha256": "a80bd4356100fcce8b2ea855e6ee3dcb0b63ccce1103c2852c058ee18d406a58"
