      "line": 188,
      "source_sha256": "d3bde3ae75f455e65caddc81ea5f8032bfcd36202636ccbf0c3a635719902faf",
      "line_text": "**Proof.** The wall subspaces of Theorem 2; every operator is the matrix of a cell-local operator in that subspace, symmetrized and diagonalized. Item 3 projects `H|wall` on the",
